Suppose $X$ is totally disconnected.  By Theorem~\ref{thm:id-shadowing-iff-totally-disconnected}, $\p{X, \text{id}_X}$ has the shadowing property, implying $\p{X, \Delta_X}$ has the $\p{1, 2}$-shadowing property.  By Lemma~\ref{lem:extension}, it follows $\p{X, G}$ has the $\p{1, 2}$-shadowing property, yielding $\p{2}$. 
