We now conclude this section with the following observation, as a generalisation of Lemma~\ref{lem:invariance-under-comp-topological}. 

\begin{corollary}
Let $\p{X, G}$ be a CR-dynamical system with $\Delta_X \subseteq G$. Then $\p{X, G}$ has the $\p{1, 2}$-shadowing property if, and only if, $\p{X, G^n}$ has the $\p{1, 2}$-shadowing property for all $n \geq 1$. 
\end{corollary}
\begin{proof}
Follows directly from Proposition~\ref{prop:invariance-under-comp-12}. 
\end{proof}





