The corresponding quantum period $\cX_{\gamma_f}$ is not subject to quantum corrections and
\begin{equation}\label{Weberhyper}
 \cX_{\gamma_f}(\epsilon)=\e^{\frac{Z_{\gamma_f}}{\epsilon}}=\e^{-\frac{2\pi \ri}{\epsilon}}.
 \end{equation}
In this example, the BPS soliton degeneracies $\mu(\gamma_{21})$ are all 1.


\subsection{Pad\'{e}-Borel summation}
