then all results in Sect. \ref{Main} apply to them, except for Theorems \ref{thm:sparse-T1} and \ref{thm:DT}, since they do not admit a \textbf{\textsf{$\mathbb{R}$-valued $m$-linear fractional Calderón-Zygmund kernel representation.}}

\end{remark}


