%\textbf{\eqref{M_1.condi.} holds for \( \mathcal{M}^{\B}_{\eta,\vec{r}} \).}

To consider \eqref{M_1.condi.}, we claim that
for any fixed $B_0 \in \B$, there is a \( B \) that satisfies $B \supsetneq B_0$ as in  \eqref{M_1.condi.}.

