\emph{{\textbf{\textsf (iii) and  (iv):}}} According to the construction of $\mathcal{G}$, if \( G^{\dagger} \not\subset F \) we only need to consider two cases for $G$: $G=B_0$, or $G=B_k$ with $k \geq 1$ and $G^{\dagger}=B_k^{\dagger} \subset F$.
