If \( \mu(B_{k+1}^{\dagger}) > \mu(A) \), then \( G^2 \subseteq A^{\dagger} = \widehat{G} \subseteq B_{k+1}^2 \). It derives from Lemma \ref{lem:aooa:4.2} part \eqref{ABF-1} and Lemma \ref{lem:aooa:4.3} part \eqref{ABC-3} that
\begin{align*}
