We establish the following Haar decomposition for the fractional BMO norm as follows.
\begin{proposition}\label{norm:FBMO}
Let $\D$ is a dyadic lattice, $r \in [1,\infty)$, and $\eta \in [0,\infty)$. Then 
\[\left\| b \right\|_{\BMO_{2,\eta }}^{} = \mathop {\sup }\limits_{R \in \D} {\left( {{{\left| R \right|}^{2\eta  - 1}}{{\sum\limits_{Q \subseteq R} {\left| {\left\langle {b,{h_Q}} \right\rangle } \right|} }^2}} \right)^{\frac{1}{2}}}.\]
