The components \( g_j \) and \( b_j \) satisfy:  
\begin{align}
{\left\langle {\left| {{g_j}} \right|} \right\rangle _{1,{P_0}}} \le {\left\langle {{f_j}}  \right\rangle _{1,{P_0}}}, &\quad \|g_j\|_{L^\infty} \lesssim_{\delta} \langle f_j \rangle_{P_0}, \label{eq:gj-bound}\\
