Thus, it is needful for us to verify \eqref{ine.3}. In fact, on the one hand,
\[{\left\langle {\left| {{g_j}} \right|} \right\rangle _R} \le {\left\langle {\left| {{f_j}} \right|} \right\rangle _{{P_0}}}.\]
