 \caption{Coordinates and sketch of the fluid domain. The flat surface is given by $z=h_1,$ the free interface of the internal wave is $z=\eta(x,t)$ and is shown by the blue curve, the variable bottom is $z=-h+\beta(x)$ and is shown by the green curve. The current profile is schematically shown in red, its magnitude $\bm{U}(z)$ is accommodated in the horizontal direction. }\label{fig1}
