	\subsection{Iterative lower bound III}
	%In this section, we propose an iterative lower bound for the error coefficients of Griesmer optimal linear codes, which rely on characterizing subcode structures.

	In this subsection, we present a lower bound on the error coefficients of linear codes by analyzing the relationships between subcode structures of linear codes.








	%	\begin{lemma}\cite{Helleseth1992Generalizedweights}\label{Generalized_Griesmer_code}
		%		Let C be an $[n,k,d]$ linear code meeting the Griesmer Bound. Then:
		%		
		%		(1) C meets the Generalized Griesmer Bound for all r with $1\le r\le k$, and
