		By Theorem \ref{k_Residue_Grismer_Bound}, we have
		$$e(15s_2+12,4,2)\ge e(3s_2+3,2,2)\varsigma_2(2,8s_2+6)+e(12s_2+8,3,2)=12 $$ for $k_2=2$.
