We evaluate LAM on datasets for DoAE, demonstrating its ability to outperform or match existing supervised methods while being robust across varied acoustic conditions\footnote{\href{https://github.com/adrianSRoman/LAM}{\texttt{https://github.com/adrianSRoman/LAM}}}. Our key contributions include:


\begin{itemize} 
    \item LAM: A self-supervised model for generating high-resolution acoustic maps from microphone array recordings.

    \item A benchmark showcasing LAM’s superior DoAE performance compared to DeepWave and signal processing methods for acoustic mapping. % SAM generation. %geDeepWave on the LOCATA speech localization dataset.

    \item An analysis of LAM’s adaptability and robustness across low- and high-resolution microphone arrays.
\end{itemize}


