% Context-Aware Guidance: Providing support that adapts to the specific situation, task phase, or environmental context, such as the workflow proposed by Verheijden et al.~\cite{verheijden2023collaborative} and the context-sensitive tool by Fu et al.~\cite{fu2024text}.
