\section{Flow Analysis, Case Analysis and Discussions}\label{sec:findings}

Our literature survey systematically analyzes human-AI co-creation, focusing on agency dynamics. We visualize these findings using a Sankey diagram (Figure~\ref{fig:co_creation}), which maps the flow and relationships across critical dimensions. This structured representation reveals prevalent patterns, interaction dynamics, and potential gaps within co-creative systems, offering concrete application guidelines relevant to CSCW research and design.

