{In this section, we present a comparative analysis of fees for the aircraft operations at the airport of  Santiago de Compostela - Rosal\'ia de Castro (IATA code: SCQ) in Galicia (Spain) on two non-working days using game-theoretic solutions as allocation mechanisms. From now on, when we refer to an operation at an airport, we mean only the take-off or landing of an aircraft.}

