such that $f^{-1}[\mathrm{UFHC}(B_{\bm{w}})]=D$. In fact, the continuity of $f$ would imply, thanks to Claim \ref{claim:complexityD}, that $\mathrm{UFHC}(B_{\bm{w}})$ is not a $F_{\sigma\delta}$-set, which will conclude the proof. 

