&\quad\quad +(c\vartriangleleft a)\vartriangleleft b\otimes k(i+k-1) t^s\\
&\quad=0,
\end{flalign*}
where $s=i+j+k-2$.\\

Comparing the coefficients of $i(i-1)t^s$, $k(k-1)t^s$, $ijt^s$ and $jkt^s$ in the above equality, we obtain
\begin{flalign*}
&(a\vartriangleright b)\vartriangleright c+(a\vartriangleleft b)\vartriangleright c-(a\vartriangleright c)\vartriangleleft b=0,\\
&(c\vartriangleleft a)\vartriangleleft b-(c\vartriangleleft b)\vartriangleleft a=0,\\
