		&\quad\quad-(\tau\ot\id)(\beta\ot\id)\tau\alpha(a)\bullet(\widehat{\tau}\hatot\id)(\db\hatot\id)\widehat{\tau}\da(x)+(\alpha\ot\id)\tau\alpha(a)
		\bullet(\da\hatot\id)\widehat{\tau}\da(x).
\end{flalign*}}
By Eqs. \eqref{RNov-Codialg-1}-\eqref{RNov-Codialg-4}, we obtain
{\small \begin{flalign*}
&(\id \hatot \db)\db(x)=(\widehat{\tau}\hatot\id)(\id\hatot\db)\db(x),\\
