&(\widehat{\tau}\hatot\id)(\id\hatot\widehat{\tau})(\id\hatot\da)\db(x)=(\widehat{\tau}\hatot\id)(\da\hatot\id)\widehat{\tau}\da(x)=(\widehat{\tau}\hatot\id)(\db\hatot\id)\widehat{\tau}\da(x),\\
