	&(x\vdash y,z)+(y\dashv x,z)+(y,z\dashv x)=0.
\end{align*}
By the nondegenerate property of $(\cdot,\cdot)$, the above equalities imply that
$(B,\dashv  ,\vdash ,(\cdot,\cdot))$
