	\begin{eqnarray*}
		x\diamond x=0,~~x\diamond y=-2x,~~y\diamond x=x,~~y\diamond y=y.
	\end{eqnarray*}
	Define a bilinear form $( \cdot ,\cdot )$ on $B$ by
