&\text{when } i \in \{0, \ldots, m-1 \}, \\
e(x+1)^{(1)} =\: &(\bigoplus_{j=0}^{m-1} e(x-i)^{(1)})  \\
&\oplus (\bigoplus_{j=2}^{n-m} e(x+i)^{(1)}) \oplus c(x-m)^{(1)}.
