    Due to the misalignment with the grid there are no boundary triangles around $\Gamma$ in the set $\mathcal{I}_2$, namely, denoting $\mathcal{I}_\Gamma:=\{\tau\in\mathcal{I} : \bar\tau\cap\Gamma\neq\emptyset\}$, we have
